{
  "_meta": {
    "title": "Talking Avatar (Wan 2.2 S2V)",
    "description": "Core ComfyUI nodes only, wired from the official video_wan2_2_14B_s2v template. Wan2.2-S2V 14B fp8 + Wan2.2 Lightning T2V v1.1 high-noise LoRA (4 steps, uni_pc/simple, CFG 1, shift 8), speech or music via wav2vec2 large english, photo as ref_image. One WanSoundImageToVideo chunk = 77 frames (80 audio frames) @ 16 fps; the builder chains WanSoundImageToVideoExtend chunks for longer audio, doubles the first latent (VAE first-frame fix, 3 frames dropped after decode), trims to the audio length and muxes the audio into the mp4."
  },
